// Test: Division by zero caught by error handling
!? {
    x = 10 / 0
    >> "no reach" ¶
} :! ##Div {
    >> "div zero caught" ¶
}

// Modulo by zero is a ##Div in every engine; it is tested in
// 15_mixed_int_float.zy (int, float and mixed) and in ZyDDT's
// runtime-operators/modulo-by-zero. The note that used to be here said the
// tree-walker panicked, which stopped being true long before it was removed.

// Verificar que div normal funciona post-error
r = 20 / 4
>> r ¶
